<!--Inspect Documentation — PublicApi
  FQN: org.blockml.bml.inspect.documentation.PublicApi-->
<inspectdocumentation:PublicApi xmlns="http://blockml.org/bml"
  xmlns:core="org.blockml.bml.core"
  xmlns:inspectcap="org.blockml.bml.inspect.capability"
  xmlns:inspectdocumentation="org.blockml.bml.inspect.documentation">

  <baseType>
    core:Documentation
  </baseType>
  <is>
    Exported API from packages/inspect/src/index.ts
  </is>
  <documentation>
    inspectBlock(fqn, registry, options?) → InspectResult
    inspectProject(fqn, options?) → InspectResult
    isLeafTypeFqn(fqn) → boolean
    projectTypeExpression(expr, typeFqn?) → InspectTypeRef | undefined
    collectNamedFqns(expr, typeFqn?) → string[]
    
    Options: depth?, rootDir?, srcDir?, libraries? (inspectProject), maxBlocks?.
    Constants: DEFAULT_INSPECT_DEPTH, MAX_INSPECT_DEPTH, DEFAULT_MAX_BLOCKS, DOC_TRUNCATE, REF_TRUNCATE.
    InspectedBlock.baseType is an InspectTypeRef. InspectedBlock.genericTypes are declared parameters (bound + default + first documentation entry). Effective members are InspectedProperty, InspectedAggregation, InspectedAssociation, and InspectedCapability lists (empty omitted; no kind field). InspectedMember.documentation is the first entry, truncated like Block documentation. InspectedBlock.references are authored documentation see entries (FQN + relation, first 8, not expanded). InspectedBlock.referencesTruncated is the remaining count when more than 8. InspectedProperty.value is a literal. InspectedAggregation.instances are authored composition children. InspectedCapability may include InspectedImplementation (language + truncated source).
  </documentation>
  <references>
    <see type="inspectcap:InspectBlock" relation="Defines" />
  </references>
</inspectdocumentation:PublicApi>
